This runs on the UI thread. css::cascade is O(rules =C3=97 elements) and the =
Mailchimp fixture has ~400 rules =C3=97 ~3k elements. Please move parse+casca=
de+layout into the background executor and cache the result keyed by (id, wid=
th_bucket).

